Description: AI Parser Extension
 AI Parser Extension provides the base functionality for Kylin AI applications.
 It offers document parsing interfaces aligned with libukui-file-metadata,
 enabling kylin-ai-document-service to utilize these functionalities effectively.
 For more information, please visit
 <https://gitlab2.kylin.com/kylinos-src/kylin-ai-parser-extension>.
